From 0b24a7778741fda335a9a2074464c69911feb1aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: drowzeys <drowzeys@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 15:10:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tui): enable an interactive fullscreen transcript
 scrollbar

The fullscreen transcript viewport never turned on the Engine's ScrollView
scrollbar, so long transcripts had no visible scroll affordance, and the
dormant Pi scrollbar contract only accepted presses exactly on the painted
one-column thumb, which is practically ungrabbable in real terminals.

- Enable the existing scrollbar: "always" option for the fullscreen body
  viewport in ChatLayout.
- Widen the Engine press hit target to a three-column span ending at the
  painted bar column and covering the full track height (engine local
  change L035).
- Factor the drag mapping into dragScrollbarTo and center the thumb under
  a press on the empty track before dragging; presses on the thumb keep
  the classic in-place grab.

Validation: tsc -p tsconfig.standalone.json clean; vitest
tui-scrollbar-interaction.test.ts (new, SGR press/drag/release sequences
through VirtualTerminal) and tui-engine-local-deltas.test.ts pass;
node scripts/source-inventory.mjs --write recorded the new test file.
